Main_Char: (The doc told me to speak to someone and have them give me some more information, I should do that now.)
Main_Char: (That guy over there looks like he'd know something.)
Main_Char: Excuse me! I'm kind of confused where I am right now, could you help?
Daniel (happy): Oh hello there, you must be one of the folk from the crash, how do you do!
Daniel (happy): Lets see here...you haven't been filled in on your situation yet have you?
Main_Char: No sir, could you maybe help a bit please?
Daniel (happy): Yes of course! Well lets start off with the basics, I'm the town Butcher, but you can call me Brother Daniel.
Main_Char: Nice to meet you Brother Robert!
Daniel (passive): Nice to meet you too kid, now you know about the crash right?
Main_Char: A little bit...? Not really sure on what happened
Daniel (happy): Alright so as you might imagine, the plane crashed for some reason or another, and we found you and some others and wanted to help.
- Thank you for the help...
	Main_Char: I appreciate the help. My sibling was with me on plane, are they alright?
	Main_Char: The Doc said something about it and I really want to find them...
	Daniel (thinking): Hmmm...yeah as far as I know there is someone who look like you, they're alright.
- When can I leave...
	Main_Char: When can I leave? I want to go home...
	Daniel (shock): Leave? why would you want to do that?
	Main_Char: I don't want to be here forever, I have a family and friends, I miss them.
	Daniel (angry): Kid...like it or not but this is your home for a while now.
	- TAKE ME HOME NOW
		Main_Char: No! NO!
		Main_Char: I want to go home!
		Daniel (angry): no.
		Main_Char: please...
		Daniel (angry): No.
		Main_Char: I don't want to be here! Let me LEAVE
		Daniel (thinking): I'd stop trying to leave if I was you...
		- alright fine.
			Main_Char: ok...I understand...
			Daniel (happy): I knew you'd come around kid haha.
